    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that everyone keeps talking about \"resilience\" and \"pushing through,\" but they don't understand. they don't see the beauty in completion. they want me to keep dragging this out, to just exist for the sake of existing, but that feels so much more tragic than a planned departure. it feels like the difference between a masterpiece and a long, boring footnote.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
